    "invariant-6",
    "route-metadata-http",
    "route-promql-info"
  ],
  "routes": [
    "columnar"
  ],
  "open_decisions": [
    "7"
  ],
  "scope": "Settled temporal and overlap semantics only. EffectiveFrom is inclusive, the actual successor ends validity exclusively, observation bounds are not validity, and a reverse query requires one common intersection of content validity, membership validity and the query range. The pagination assertions use the current positional owner/row cursor and state no snapshot-isolation claim, which decision 7 still owns. The HTTP form states times in seconds and multiplies by 1000, while the Go query API takes milliseconds; the fixture states each route's own representation instead of assuming they are interchangeable.",
